flowchart TB
  accTitle: One chatbot turn
  accDescr: A local model sorts the question first; every intent except in-scope gets a fixed reply without the chatbot model, and a question the classifier can't sort goes on to the model. Otherwise the model calls tools in a loop of at most eight calls; its answer then passes an empty-answer check, a check of the whole draft before it is returned (quote marks around words no search returned count as unretrieved evidence; a figure or a reading such as slightly positive that no tool returned is also caught); a draft that fails is written again once with the problem named, then trimmed of the sentences that state it, and withheld if too little is left, so no warning is ever shown; the citations it retrieved are numbered with their sources listed, before it is shown.

  q(["Question"])
  cls{"Intent classifier (local model):<br/>what is the question asking for?"}
  fixR["Fixed reply for that intent<br/>(config/intents.yaml)"]
  ctx["System prompt + conversation state<br/>+ last three turns"]
  llm["Model: final text<br/>or tool calls"]
  tc{"Tool calls?"}
  tools["Run the tools,<br/>record calls and results"]
  cap{"Eight model calls used?"}
  budget["Answer: couldn't finish<br/>within the budget"]
  emp{"Empty, or just braces?"}
  empR["Fixed reply: couldn't answer,<br/>with an example question"]
  chk{"Cites evidence no search returned,<br/>states a figure no tool returned, or<br/>describes the mood in words no tool returned?"}
  used{"Second try already used?"}
  again["Tell the model what was wrong,<br/>and write the answer again"]
  trim["Drop the sentences with the<br/>unconfirmed figure or reading"]
  left{"Enough left to be an answer?"}
  wh["Fixed reply: couldn't back up an answer"]
  refs["Number the citations it retrieved,<br/>list their sources under the answer"]
  out(["Answer and turn record"])

  q --> cls
  cls -- "advice, another bank, small talk, help,<br/>service, injection, feedback, off-topic" --> fixR --> out
  cls -- "in scope, or no answer" --> ctx --> llm --> tc
  tc -- yes --> tools --> cap
  cap -- no --> llm
  cap -- yes --> budget --> emp
  tc -- no --> emp
  emp -- yes --> empR --> out
  emp -- no --> chk
  chk -- no --> refs --> out
  chk -- yes --> used
  used -- no --> again --> llm
  used -- yes --> trim --> left
  left -- yes --> refs
  left -- no --> wh --> out
